{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54039","headline":"临寂示颂（题拟） · 良价","name":"临寂示颂（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"学者恒沙无一悟，过在寻他舌头路。\n欲得忘形泯踪迹，努力殷懃空里步。\n（以上均见《大正新修大藏经》第四七册《筠州洞山悟本禅师语录》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"良价","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}